msgid "One bot for both directions: it forwards every new incoming SMS to the chosen chat and, if allowed below, sends SMS by the /sms command from that chat. Works with the ACTIVE modem: messages from the SIM of the other modem are not forwarded until you switch to it. The very first run only remembers the current messages and sends nothing. Settings live here only - the outgoing page just points at them."
msgstr "一个机器人负责双向通信：它将每条新收到的短信转发到所选聊天，若在下方允许，还可通过该聊天的 /sms 命令发送短信。仅对当前活动的模块生效：另一模块 SIM 卡收到的短信在切换过去之前不会转发。首次运行仅记录当前短信，不发送任何内容。设置只保存在此处——发送页面仅引用这些设置。"

msgid "SMS can also be sent from a Telegram chat - set the bot up on the Inbox settings page."
msgstr "也可以从 Telegram 聊天发送短信——请在收件箱设置页面配置机器人。"

